    <!-- About -->
    <sys:String x:Key="About.Tagline">Tagline</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.TibiaFoundryIsAnIndependentDesktop">Tibia Foundry is an independent desktop toolkit developed to support the Tibia community. It provides a collection of asset management, graphics generation, conversion, data exploration, and content-production tools designed to assist Tibia fansite administrators, wiki editors, artists, and creators.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.ItReadsTheOfficialFilesOf">It reads the official files of your installed Tibia client and turns them into material for wikis, fansites, guides and galleries: sprites and animated GIFs, outfit, creature and house images, maps, sounds, item and creature data, and NPC trade tables, each with your attribution.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.CreatedBy">Created by</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.For">, for</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.AndTheTibiaFansiteCommunity" xml:space="preserve"> and the Tibia fansite community.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.CreatorLinks">Creator links</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.AttributionInYourExports">Attribution in your exports</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.ChangeName">Change name…</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.OpenSettingsToSetTheCreator">Open Settings to set the creator name written into your exports</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.AttributionText">Attribution text</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.TibiaFoundryWritesThisLineInto">Tibia Foundry writes this line into the metadata of every PNG and GIF image you export. The image itself is not changed.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.Credits">Credits</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.TibiaItsGameGraphicsAndData">Tibia, its game graphics and data are © CipSoft GmbH; Tibia is a trademark of CipSoft GmbH. The logos are shown to credit these organizations and link to their websites. Tibia Foundry is an independent community project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by CipSoft GmbH or Fandom; it is not part of CipSoft's Fansite Programme. Graphics you export remain CipSoft's; publish them according to CipSoft's rules for fansites.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.OpenSourceAcknowledgments">Open-source acknowledgments</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.TheseOpenSourceProjectsInspiredOr">These open-source projects inspired, or were used to check, the RCC Editor, the Client Converter and the Assets Editor. Tibia Foundry implements these tools itself and includes no code from them.</sys:String>
