    <sys:String x:Key="About.AnEditorForTheClientS">An editor for the client's Qt resource file. Tibia Foundry's RCC Editor covers the same tasks with its own reading and writing of the Qt resource format.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.MITDeclaredInTheProjectS">MIT (declared in the project's package.json)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.ConvertsTheModernClientSAssets">Converts the modern client's assets to Tibia.dat and Tibia.spr. Its output was used as a reference to check Tibia Foundry's Client Converter.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.NoLicensePublished">No license published</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.AssetsEditor">Assets Editor</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.AnEditorForTheModernClient">An editor for the modern client's appearances and sprite sheets. Its feature set was the checklist for Tibia Foundry's Assets Editor.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.GoogleProtobufBSD3ClauseReads">Google.Protobuf (BSD-3-Clause): reads and writes the client's data files</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.MagickNETImageMagickApache20">Magick.NET / ImageMagick (Apache-2.0): encodes animated GIFs and decodes images for the editors and scripts</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.NAudioAndNVorbisMITDecodeAnd">NAudio and NVorbis (MIT): decode and play the client's sounds</sys:String>
