    <sys:String x:Key="ClientConverter.WritesTheOfficialClientSModern">Writes the official client's modern assets in the classic Tibia.dat and Tibia.spr formats, and identifies legacy files you find in old client archives. Use it to compare today's objects and sprites with classic-era versions for history articles, to open the assets in legacy-format viewers and sprite tools, or to slice sprites for galleries.</sys:String>
