    <sys:String x:Key="TibiaProjectAuditorScript.ChecksAFolderOfTibiaFiles">Checks a folder of Tibia files, such as an archived client or a fansite's graphics and export library: which client files it holds, whether every file a catalog-content.json lists exists (and, optionally, whether sprite sheets match the checksum in their names), files a catalog does not list, duplicate names, empty or tiny files, and extensions that do not match the content. Compares with a checksum manifest when you give one. Nothing is changed.</sys:String>
